  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mythic power gives you additional uses of lay on hands each day.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Extra Lay On Hands<sup>CRB</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can lay on hands an additional three times per day. Additionally if you have no uses of lay on hands remaining, you may expend two uses of mythic power to use your lay on hands ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Unlike Extra Lay On Hands, you cannot take Mythic Extra Lay On Hands more than once.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-extra-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
